# ── Backend (Render) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Comma-separated list of allowed frontend origins for CORS.
# Since both frontend and backend are served from the same Render service,
# this is mainly needed if you access the API from a custom domain.
# Example: https://zenalert-api.onrender.com,https://zenalert.yourdomain.com
FRONTEND_ORIGINS=

# ── Frontend Configuration ───────────────────────────────────
# The API base URL is auto-detected as same-origin when served by FastAPI.
# You only need to configure this if you split frontend/backend later:
#   frontend/js/api.js  →  PRODUCTION_API_URL constant
# OR via an inline <script> tag setting window.ZENALERT_API_BASE

# ── Map Tiles ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The default setup uses free OpenFreeMap dark vector tiles — no API key needed.
# If you want to switch to a vector tile provider, set the key here
# and update the style URL in frontend/js/map.js
# MAPTILER_API_KEY=
# MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# STADIA_API_KEY=
